Not included
------------
    The upstream single rotating jaw is used on the left arm first. The right
    arm uses the ggao50 SO101 Parallel Gripper. Because that repository
    carries no licence statement, its meshes are NOT redistributed here. The
    right gripper URDF uses a dimensional proxy authored for this project in
    urdf/ggao50_gripper.xacro, based on measurements of the published STLs.

        https://github.com/ggao50/SO101-Parallel-Gripper

Joint convention
----------------
    shoulder_pan   limit  +/- 1.91986 rad
    shoulder_lift  limit  +/- 1.74533 rad
    elbow_flex     limit  +/- 1.69000 rad
    wrist_flex     limit  +/- 1.65806 rad
    wrist_roll     limit  -2.74385 .. 2.84121 rad

    Names match arm_shoulder_pan / arm_shoulder_lift / arm_elbow_flex /
    arm_wrist_flex / arm_wrist_roll in the JD-AMR chain, with the arm_
    prefix replaced by the left_ / right_ macro prefix.
